<div class="ac-record-page"><a class="ac-record-back" href="/conscious/admin/bank-accounts"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left"></i> Back to payout accounts</a><div class="ac-callout info mt-3" id="abr-message" role="status">Loading payout account…</div><div class="ac-record-layout mt-3"><main class="ac-record-primary"><section class="ac-card"><div class="ac-head"><div><span class="ac-kicker">PAYOUT ACCOUNT</span><h2 id="abr-title">Bank account review</h2><p class="ac-help" id="abr-subtitle"></p></div><span id="abr-status"></span></div><div class="ac-body"><section class="ac-record-section"><h3>Seller and account details</h3><div class="ac-record-facts" id="abr-facts"></div></section><section class="ac-record-section"><div class="ac-section-heading"><div><span class="ac-kicker">BANK PROOF</span><h3>Uploaded evidence</h3></div></div><div id="abr-proof"></div></section><section class="ac-record-section"><h3>Review history</h3><div class="ac-timeline" id="abr-history"></div></section></div></section></main><aside class="ac-record-aside"><section class="ac-card"><div class="ac-head"><div><span class="ac-kicker">DECISION</span><h2>Review controls</h2></div></div><div class="ac-body"><div class="ac-callout" id="abr-readiness"></div><div class="abr-sensitive" id="abr-sensitive" hidden></div><div class="ac-form-actions" id="abr-actions"></div><p class="ac-help">Account number and IFSC stay encrypted. An authorized finance administrator can temporarily unlock them for an audited payout purpose.</p></div></section></aside></div></div>
<dialog class="ac-dialog" id="abr-decision-dialog"><form id="abr-decision-form" novalidate><div class="ac-dialog-head"><div><span class="ac-kicker">VENDOR-VISIBLE DECISION</span><h2 id="abr-dialog-title">Provide a reason</h2></div><button class="ac-btn small" type="button" id="abr-dialog-close"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div><div class="ac-body"><p id="abr-dialog-copy"></p><label class="ac-field" for="abr-reason"><span>Reason shown to the vendor</span><textarea class="ac-textarea" id="abr-reason" minlength="10" maxlength="500" placeholder="Explain what is incorrect and what proof or bank details must be submitted next."></textarea><small class="av-field-error" id="abr-reason-error" role="alert" hidden></small></label></div><div class="ac-form-actions"><button class="ac-btn" type="button" id="abr-dialog-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="ac-btn primary" type="submit" id="abr-dialog-submit">Send decision</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog class="ac-dialog" id="abr-reveal-dialog"><form id="abr-reveal-form" novalidate><div class="ac-dialog-head"><div><span class="ac-kicker">SENSITIVE PAYMENT DATA</span><h2>Unlock bank details</h2></div><button class="ac-btn small" type="button" id="abr-reveal-close"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div><div class="ac-body"><div class="ac-callout warning">This access is recorded in the audit log. Reveal details only when preparing or verifying a payout.</div><label class="ac-field mt-3" for="abr-reveal-purpose"><span>Payment access purpose</span><textarea class="ac-textarea" id="abr-reveal-purpose" minlength="10" maxlength="300" required placeholder="Example: Preparing payout request PAY-1042 for bank transfer."></textarea><small class="av-field-error" id="abr-reveal-error" role="alert" hidden></small></label></div><div class="ac-form-actions"><button class="ac-btn" type="button" id="abr-reveal-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="ac-btn primary" type="submit" id="abr-reveal-submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock-open"></i> Unlock details</button></div></form></dialog>
